        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-17T05:34:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Amusingly enough, one of the biggest locally headquartered banking companies (though probably a good deal smaller than Wells Fargo, I'd imagine) here in Minnesota is called Twin City Federal…</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Greywind wrote:</b><br><blockquote>\"The Compassionate Friends\"?</blockquote></div>\nThe most deadly ships in all of the galaxy...\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>At the moment I'm randomly reading an X-Force comic, and it has a gang of murderous thugs called the Friends of Humanity (they only kill <em>mutants</em>, y'know).&nbsp; It's pretty funny to hear these referred to as \"Friends\" for short in very aggressive contexts.</p>",
